  "label": "Adolf Hitler as Historical Figure",
  "description": "Adolf Hitler was the leader of Nazi Germany and the primary architect of the Holocaust, during which approximately six million Jews were systematically murdered. His presence in the image is not just a visual element but a direct reference to one of history’s most horrific genocides. Understanding the meme requires knowledge of his role in the Holocaust and the global historical trauma associated with his regime.",
